This includes, but is not limited to, financial statements, financial information, non-financial information and regulatory filings such as annual and quarterly financial statements.

Based on XBRL (eXtensible Business Reporting Language) Specification
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.xbrl.org/Specification/XBRL-2.1/REC-2003-12-31/XBRL-2.1-REC-2003-12-31+corrected-errata-2013-02-20.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.xbrl.org/Specification/XBRL-2.1/REC-2003-12-31/XBRL-2.1-REC-…&lt;/a&gt;

