Source: Based on the concepts laid out in &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.europarl.europa.eu/RegData/etudes/etudes/join/2013/507457/IPOL-IMCO_ET(2013)507457_EN.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.europarl.europa.eu/RegData/etudes/etudes/join/2013/507457/IP…&lt;/a&gt;</skos:definition>
