Public Service Consumer ABB is a Business Role consuming public services.

Source: EIF 2.0 (&lt;a href=&quot;http://ec.europa.eu/isa/documents/isa_annex_ii_eif_en.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://ec.europa.eu/isa/documents/isa_annex_ii_eif_en.pdf&lt;/a&gt;)

