The Public Service Consumer ABB is salient for organisational interoperability because it is one of the main actors involved in the interoperability of the public service as stated in the EIF: &quot;Service orientation, upon which the conceptual model for public services is conceived, means that the relationship between service providers and service consumers must be clearly defined&quot;. EIF Recommendation n.29 also suggests:
&quot;Clarify and formalise your organisational relationships for establishing and operating European public services.&quot;

