  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PublicServiceDeliveryAgent">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Public Service Delivery Agent ABB is a Business Role delivering a public service on behalf of a principal.

