Source:(&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.brainkart.com/article/Functional-Requirements---Software-Architectures_11271/#:~:text=The%20following%20are%20examples%20of%20explicit%20architectural%20requirements%3A,Functionality%208%20Usability%209%20Reliability%20More%20items...%20&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.brainkart.com/article/Functional-Requirements---Software-Ar…&lt;/a&gt;)</skos:definition>
