  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/BusinessProcessManagerTechnologyService">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Business Process Manager ABB is a Technology Service that implements the behaviour of coordinates the behavior of people, systems, information and things to produce business outcomes in support of a business strategy

Source: Gartner

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/business-process-management-bpm&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/business-pro…&lt;/a&gt;

