    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Containers Registry ABB is a Technology Service that enables the procedures to elaborate a repository of a collection of registries used to store and access container images

Source: Redhat

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.redhat.com/en/topics/cloud-native-apps/what-is-a-container-registry&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.redhat.com/en/topics/cloud-native-apps/what-is-a-container-…&lt;/a&gt;

