Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Project QUAY, Quay is a container image registry that enables you to build, organize, distribute, and deploy containers. Quay gives you security over your repositories with image vulnerability scanning and robust access controls. Project Quay provides a scalable open source platform to host container images across any size organization. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.projectquay.io/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.projectquay.io/&lt;/a&gt;

