  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EventManagerTechnologyService">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Event Manager ABB is a Technology Service that implements the behaviour of collecting, analyzing, and responding to events or alerts generated by various digital platforms, including servers, applications, network devices, and security appliances

