Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Standard forms for public procurement - o help you publish EU public procurement data in the Official Journal, the European Commission has created standard forms aligned with each of the EU legal bases in place for publishing this data, namely: - TED schema forms set out in Regulation (EU) 2015/1986; - eForms set out in Regulation (EU) 2019/1780. &lt;a href=&quot;https://simap.ted.europa.eu/standard-forms-for-public-procurement&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://simap.ted.europa.eu/standard-forms-for-public-procurement&lt;/a&gt;

