    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/view/SemanticView"/>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/OpenDataRepresentation">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Open Data ABB is a Representation of the information collected, produced or paid for by the public bodies and made freely available for re-use for any purpose

Source: European Comission

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://data.europa.eu/en/trening/what-open-data&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://data.europa.eu/en/trening/what-open-data&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): datos.gob.es &lt;a href=&quot;https://datos.gob.es/en&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://datos.gob.es/en&lt;/a&gt;

LOST view: Semantic view

Interoperability saliency: The Open Data Representation ABB is salient for semantic interoperability because it is the basis for sharing, reusing and making available relevant and public information from public organisations and the digital public services delivery.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/OpenDataRepresentation&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/OpenDataRepresentation&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB512

ABB name: eira:OpenDataRepresentation

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-16-01</skos:definition>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
