    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Kibana at EU. https://big-data-test-infrastructure.ec.europa.eu/service-offering/kibana_en</skos:example>
