    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): FENIX is an infrastructure research project that incorporates cloud computing facilities from ICT Solutions for Brilliant Minds. https://fenix-ri.eu/about-fenix/project-partners</skos:example>
