    <eira:definitionSource>European Comission-Unleashing the Potential of Cloud Computing in Europe</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Cloud Computing Facility ABB is salient for organizational interoperability due to it provides the business rules and responsibilities to publish and manage the public administration services.</eira:iopSaliency>
