  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2022-01-31</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Computing Hosting, Networking, and Data Hosting Infrastructure ABB are a Technology Service that enables the functionalities for i) hosting Interoperable European Solutions and ii) providing the necessary networks for operating these solutions.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Computing Hosting, Networking, and Data Hosting Infrastructure</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Computing Hosting, Networking, and Data Hosting Infrastructure</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):DIGIT Hosting and Networking Infrastructure Service</skos:example>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService</eira:PURI>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:definitionSource>ISA2 - EIA Action</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:viewpoint>Interoperability Security viewpoint</eira:viewpoint>
    <eira:viewpoint>Key Interoperability Enablers viewpoint</eira:viewpoint>
    <eira:viewpoint>Highlevel viewpoint</eira:viewpoint>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Computing Hosting, Networking and Data Hosting Infrastructure ABB is a key enabler interoperability enabler (*) for structural interoperability by enabling all the functionalities to host the Interoperable European Solutions  (high availability and high-performance hosting infrastructure) and the network that can operate these solutions (a public and private network). Hosting and networking represent the lower level of the technical layer, but to be considered when designing an interoperable solution, as they can create interoperability barriers. Interoperability technical specifications need to be used at this level to ensure interoperability of the levels above.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService"/>
    <eira:view>Technical view - infrastructure</eira:view>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/news/isa2-interoperability-solutions-european-public-administrations-first-work-programme-adopted</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingInfrastructureEnablers_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Computing Infrastructure Enablers ABB is a Grouping that refers to components and services that provide the development, deployment, and management of virtual and computing infrastructure</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Computing Infrastructure Enablers</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Computing Infrastructure Enablers</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:ComputingInfrastructureEnablers</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): DIGIT/C Hosting Service - DIGIT/C offers a high availability and high performance hosting infrastructure that is being comprised, among other elements, of back-end web server instances and application servers for hosting and serving both static and dynamic sites. http://ec.europa.eu/ipg/build/infrastructure/index_en.htm</skos:example>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingInfrastructureEnablers</eira:PURI>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:definitionSource>Inspired in Redhat</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Computing Infrastructure Enablers ABB is salient for organizational and technical interoperability due to it providing (i) mechanisms to ensure the correct publication of public administration digital services, and (ii) physical elements that permit to host of public administration services in a standardised manner.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingInfrastructureEnablers"/>
    <eira:view>Technical view - infrastructure</eira:view>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://www.redhat.com/en/topics/virtualization/what-is-a-virtual-machine</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingInfrastructureEnablers_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingInfrastructureEnablers</dc:identifier>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ConfigurationAndSolutionCartographyServiceComponent_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Configuration and Solution Cartography Service Component</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Configuration and Solution Cartography Service Component</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:ConfigurationAndSolutionCartographyServiceComponent</dc:type>
    <eira:ID>ABB213</eira:ID>
    <eira:ABB_Status>Obsolete</eira:ABB_Status>
    <owl:deprecated>true</owl:deprecated>
    <skos:related>
      <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ConfigurationAndSolutionCartographyServiceComponent">
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DESCRIPTION:
Implements the functionality of documenting the configuration and architecture of solutions.

Source: ISA2 - EIA Action

INTEROPERABILITY SALIENCY:
The Configuration and Solution of Cartography Component ABB &amp;nbsp;is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the implementation of the functionalities which can be exploited to document the interoperabilty features of a solution or a set of solution/services.

EXAMPLES:
The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):

Essential
The EA Essential tool provides with a semantically-rich meta-model. This means accurate modelling which allows for sophisticated reporting. Essential can be configured to import data from a wide range of sources such as CMDBs, Business Process Modelling tools, PMO tools, etc. The Essential Import Utility REST API allows to schedule automated imports from external data sources to keep the repository accurate and current. Complex queries can be built on the repository using the query wizard in Essential Open Source.
In addition to traditional the Enterprise Architecture assets, Essential also manages information about the entire organization including resources, skills, contracts, risk, security and more.
&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.enterprise-architecture.org/features.php&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.enterprise-architecture.org/features.php&lt;/a&gt;</skos:definition>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Configuration and Solution Cartography Service Component</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/Deprecated"/>
        <owl:deprecated>true</owl:deprecated>
        <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ConfigurationAndSolutionCartographyService"/>
      </skos:Concept>
    </skos:related>

    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ConfigurationAndSolutionCartographyServiceComponent_Properties</dc:identifier>
  </skos:Concept>

