    <eira:iopSaliency>Machine Learning ABB is salient for semantic interoperability because it refers to the generation of newer insights (knowledge) from public data to generate (i) new curated datasets and/or (ii) new public data assets based on the combination of other public data.</eira:iopSaliency>
