  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/OnceOnly_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Once Only</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Once Only</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:OnceOnly</dc:type>
    <eira:ID>ABB391</eira:ID>
    <eira:ABB_Status>Obsolete</eira:ABB_Status>
    <skos:related>
      <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/OnceOnly">
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Once Only ABB is a Principle entailing that citizens and businesses provide diverse data only once in contact with public administrations, while public administration bodies take actions to internally share and reuse these data – even across borders – always in respect of data protection regulations and other constraints.

Source: Europa
(&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/CEFDIGITAL/2018/10/25/TOOP:+The+Once-Only+Principle#:~:text=On%201%20January%202017%2C%20the%20European%20Commission%20launched,diverse%20data%20only%20once%20to%20a%20public%20administration&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/CEFDIGITAL/2…&lt;/a&gt;.)

EXAMPLES:
The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):&amp;nbsp;</skos:definition>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Once Only</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/Deprecated"/>
        <owl:deprecated>true</owl:deprecated>
      </skos:Concept>
    </skos:related>

    <owl:deprecated>true</owl:deprecated>
