    <owl:deprecated>true</owl:deprecated>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/OrganisationalSkill_Properties</dc:identifier>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/OrganisationalStructure_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Organisational Structure</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Organisational Structure</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:OrganisationalStructure</dc:type>
    <eira:ID>ABB14</eira:ID>
    <eira:ABB_Status>Obsolete</eira:ABB_Status>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/OrganisationalStructure"/>
    <owl:deprecated>true</owl:deprecated>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/OrganisationalStructure_Properties</dc:identifier>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PKICertificateManagerTechnologyService_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>PKI Certificate Manager ABB is a Technology Service that enables the procedures to issue, maintain and revoke public key certificates</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of PKI Certificate Manager</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of PKI Certificate Manager</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:PKICertificateManagerTechnologyService</dc:type>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PKICertificateManagerTechnologyService</eira:PURI>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): eDelivery - PKI Service. https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/PKI+Service</skos:example>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:definitionSource>NIST</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:iopSaliency>PKI Certificate Manager ABB is salient for technical interoperability because permits the public services to exchange information through the use of digital certificates that permit the accessibility to such service.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PKICertificateManagerTechnologyService"/>
    <eira:view>Technical view - infrastructure</eira:view>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PKICertificateManagerTechnologyService_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PKICertificateManagerTechnologyService</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://csrc.nist.gov/glossary/term/public_key_infrastructure</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PaaSTechnologyService_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2022-01-31</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>PaaS ABB is a Technology Service that enables the procedures for delivering application infrastructure (middleware) capabilities as a service. There are multiple types of PaaS (xPaaS), including, among many more, application platform as a service (aPaaS), integration PaaS (iPaaS), API management PaaS (apimPaaS), function PaaS (fPaaS), business analytics PaaS (baPaaS), IoT PaaS and database PaaS (dbPaaS). PaaS capability can be delivered as provider-managed or self-managed, multitenant or dedicated.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of PaaS</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of PaaS</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:PaaSTechnologyService</dc:type>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PaaSTechnologyService</eira:PURI>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): OpenSHIFT is a secure and an enterprise-grade cloud-based container orchestration system with Kubernetes at the backend. It can be used both as a Red Hat Container Orchestration Engine and Platform-as-a-Service (PaaS). https://github.com/openshift/origin</skos:example>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:definitionSource>Gartner</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopDimension>Behavioral IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The PaaS ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the mechanism to deploy and publish public administration services and make them accessible through the provided remote infrastructure.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PaaSTechnologyService"/>
    <eira:view>Technical view - infrastructure</eira:view>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PaaSTechnologyService</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PaaSTechnologyService_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/platform-as-a-service-paas</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PartnerManagementComponent_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Partner Management Component</skos:notation>
