             §10
          Applicable law
            &lt;p&gt;This License is governed by German law, excluding its conflict of laws
            provisions and the provisions of the UN Convention on Contracts for the
            International Sale of Goods (CISG).&lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;/li&gt;
      
&lt;/ul&gt;
       
        &lt;p&gt;END OF TERMS AND CONDITIONS&lt;/p&gt;</spdx:licenseTextHtml>
