          August 1, 2009, provided the MMC is eligible for relicensing.
        &lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;/li&gt;
    
&lt;/ul&gt;
     
      &lt;p&gt;
        ADDENDUM: How to use this License for your documents
      &lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;p&gt;
        To use this License in a document you have written, include
