&lt;ul&gt;
                
&lt;li&gt;
                     1. Definitions
                    
&lt;ul&gt;
                        
&lt;li&gt;
                             a. &quot;Attribution&quot; means acknowledging all the parties who have contributed to and have rights in the Work
