              &lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;/li&gt;
            
&lt;li&gt;
 ###  7.4. Attorneys' Fees
              &lt;p&gt;
In any action to enforce the terms of this License, or seeking damages 
relating thereto, including by an intended third-party beneficiary, the 
