            &lt;p&gt;The Licensor grants you a worldwide, royalty-free, perpetual, non-exclusive licence to use the Information for Non-Commercial purposes only subject to the conditions below.&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;p&gt;This licence does not affect your freedom under fair dealing or fair use or any other copyright or database right exceptions and limitations.&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;p&gt;You are free to:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
                
