&lt;li&gt;adapt the Information;&lt;/li&gt;
                
&lt;li&gt;exploit the Information for Non-Commercial purposes for example, by combining it with other information in your own product or application.&lt;/li&gt;
            
&lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;You are not permitted to:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
                
&lt;li&gt;exercise any of the rights granted to you by this licence in any manner that is primarily intended for or directed toward commercial advantage or private monetary compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
            
