as a verb, means doing any act which is restricted by copyright or database right, whether in the original medium or in any other medium, and includes without limitation distributing, copying, adapting, modifying as may be technically necessary to use it in a different mode or format.&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;p&gt;'You'
means the natural or legal person, or body of persons corporate or incorporate, acquiring rights under this licence.&lt;/p&gt;</spdx:licenseTextHtml>
