    <spdx:licenseTextHtml xml:lang="en">&lt;p&gt;Norwegian Licence for Open Government Data (NLOD) 2.0&lt;/p&gt;

      
          &lt;p&gt;Preface of licence&lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;p&gt;This licence grants you the right to copy, use and distribute
         information, provided you acknowledge the contributors and
         comply with the terms and conditions stipulated in this
