    &lt;p&gt;This is the Open Use of Data Agreement, Version 1.0 (the &quot;O-UDA&quot;). Capitalized terms are defined in Section 5. Data Provider and you agree as follows:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
        
