          &quot;Acknowledgements&quot;, and any sections Entitled &quot;Dedications&quot;.
          You must delete all sections Entitled &quot;Endorsements&quot;.
        &lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;/li&gt;
      
&lt;li&gt;
         6.
        COLLECTIONS OF DOCUMENTS
        &lt;p&gt;
          You may make a collection consisting of the Document and
