        &lt;p&gt;All Derivative Works are subject to the terms of this License. You may copy and distribute a Derivative Work of the Document under the conditions of Section 2 above, provided that You release the Derivative Work under the exact, verbatim terms of this License (i.e., the Derivative Work is licensed as a &quot;Document&quot; under the terms of this License). In addition, Derivative Works of Documents must meet the following requirements: 
        
