          stated above, and you may publicly display copies.
        &lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;/li&gt;
      
&lt;li&gt;
         3.
        COPYING IN QUANTITY
        &lt;p&gt;
          If you publish printed copies of the Document numbering more than
