  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/RouterTechnologyService">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Router ABB is a Technology Service that enables the implementation of a component to connect multiple networks and directs traffic between them

Source: ISO 35.110

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.iso.org/ics/35.110/x/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.iso.org/ics/35.110/x/&lt;/a&gt;

