  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SemanticFunctionalContentGrouping">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Semantic Functional Content ABB is a Grouping that refers to the procedures and mechanims to structure and organise the information to convey meaning and functionality.

Source: Inspired in &quot;Semantic Content&quot; article

