    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Technical Agreement ABB is a Contract formalising a framework and a privileged forum to identify common interests, priorities, policy dialogue, and the necessary tools for Strategic &amp;amp; Technological collaboration.

Source: EUR-LEX

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur-lex.europa.eu/collection/eu-law/inter-agree.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://eur-lex.europa.eu/collection/eu-law/inter-agree.html&lt;/a&gt;

