  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/VirtualDatasetDataObject">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Virtual Dataset ABB is a Data Object that enables a dynamic and logical representation of data that aggregates, integrates, or transforms data from multiple sources into a single view

Source: H5PY

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.h5py.org/en/stable/vds.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://docs.h5py.org/en/stable/vds.html&lt;/a&gt;

