  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/VirtualMachineNode">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Virtual Machine ABB is a Node that enables the emulation of a physical computer to run programs and deploy applications.

Source: Inspired in Redhat

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.redhat.com/en/topics/virtualization/what-is-a-virtual-machine&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.redhat.com/en/topics/virtualization/what-is-a-virtual-machi…&lt;/a&gt;

