  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SoftwareComponentDiscoveryandCatalogueApplicationService_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2022-01-18</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Software Component Discovery and Catalogue Service ABB is an Application Service containing information about software products and serves as an index during software scans to automatically identify the software products installed on a monitored computer but also getting knowledge on units of composition with contractually specified interfaces and explicit context dependencies.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Software Component Discovery and Catalogue</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Software Component Discovery and Catalogue</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:SoftwareComponentDiscoveryandCatalogueApplicationService</dc:type>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SoftwareComponentDiscoveryandCatalogueApplicationService</eira:PURI>
    <skos:example></skos:example>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:definitionSource>Dictionary</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:iopSaliency>Software Component Discovery and Catalogue Service ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for structural interoperability by sharing public administration services and making them available and findable across public administrations and borders.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:viewpoint>Key Interoperability Enablers viewpoint</eira:viewpoint>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SoftwareComponentDiscoveryandCatalogueApplicationService"/>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SoftwareComponentDiscoveryandCatalogueApplicationService</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SoftwareComponentDiscoveryandCatalogueApplicationService_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>(https://www.dictionary.com/browse/catalog)</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SoftwareComponentsCatalogueDataObject_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2022-01-20</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Software Components Catalogue ABB is a Data Object aiming to index information about collaborative spaces that offfers eGoverment solutions and best practices.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Software Components Catalogue</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Software Components Catalogue</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:SoftwareComponentsCatalogueDataObject</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Software ReUse Catalogue (Belgium) https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/belgian-interoperability-catalogue/solution/ict-reuse/about</skos:example>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SoftwareComponentsCatalogueDataObject</eira:PURI>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:iopDimension>Behavioral IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:definitionSource>Joinup</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Software Components Catalogue Data Object ABB is salient for semantic interoperability because it can act as a repository with descriptive data about digital solutions and interoperable solutions and best practices. This can contribute to expanding and enabling the reuse of artefacts, solutions, and services to implement new digital public services without starting from scratch. The reuse of such elements can infer knowledge and best practices from the collaboration between parties.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SoftwareComponentsCatalogueDataObject"/>
    <eira:view>Semantic view</eira:view>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SoftwareComponentsCatalogueDataObject_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SoftwareComponentsCatalogueDataObject</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/topic/ict/reusable-software-components</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SolutionBuildingBlockArtifact_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Solution Building Block ABB is an Artifact that enables the implementation of one or more EIRA Architecture Building Blocks of a European Public Service.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Solution Building Block</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Solution Building Block</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:SolutionBuildingBlockArtifact</dc:type>
    <skos:example></skos:example>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SolutionBuildingBlockArtifact</eira:PURI>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopDimension>Behavioral IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:definitionSource>ISA2</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:viewpoint>EIRA Ontology viewpoint</eira:viewpoint>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Solution Building Block ABB is salient for the technical interoperability due to establishing the technical aspects related to the definition of architecture and public service architectural principles to support public administration in the service delivery.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SolutionBuildingBlockArtifact"/>
    <eira:view>Technical view - application</eira:view>
    <eira:view>Semantic view</eira:view>
    <eira:view>Organisational view</eira:view>
    <eira:view>Technical view - infrastructure</eira:view>
    <eira:view>Legal view</eira:view>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SolutionBuildingBlockArtifact_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SolutionBuildingBlockArtifact</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/default/files/e-government_core_vocabularies_handbook.pdf</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note>Solution Builsing Block ABB is formulated as an agreed normative statement in design terms on a legal, organisational, semantic, or technical attribute of an European Public Service. On the technical view, a Solution Building Block is a specific software component that it might be either procured or developed of a To-Be Interoperable European Solution or that it is integrated in an As-Is Interoperable European Solution</skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

