            intellectual property rights are granted or should be implied.
          &lt;/li&gt;
        
&lt;/ul&gt;
      &lt;/li&gt;
      
&lt;li&gt;
         Section 3.
        Conditions on Rights Granted
        
&lt;ul&gt;
          
&lt;li&gt;
             3.1
