    <spdx:licenseTextHtml xml:lang="en">&lt;p&gt;Common Public License Version 1.0&lt;/p&gt;

      
      &lt;p&gt;THE ACCOMPANYING PROGRAM IS PROVIDED UNDER THE TERMS OF THIS COMMON PUBLIC LICENSE
         (&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;). ANY USE, REPRODUCTION OR DISTRIBUTION OF THE PROGRAM CONSTITUTES
