       1.
      &lt;p&gt;DEFINITIONS&lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;p&gt;&quot;Contribution&quot; means:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
          
&lt;li&gt;
             a)
            in the case of the initial Contributor, the initial code and documentation distributed under
               this Agreement, and
          &lt;/li&gt;
          
&lt;li&gt;
