      &lt;p&gt;You can use DOC software in commercial and/or binary software releases and are under no obligation to
         redistribute any of your source code that is built using DOC software. Note, however, that you may not
         misappropriate the DOC software code, such as copyrighting it yourself or claiming authorship of the
