        &lt;/li&gt;
        
&lt;li&gt;
             4.
          Contacts
          &lt;p&gt;There are two mailing lists related to FreeType:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
               
&lt;li&gt;
                   o
              &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:freetype@nongnu.org&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;freetype@nongnu.org&lt;/a&gt;
              &lt;p&gt;Discusses general use and applications of FreeType, as well as future and wanted additions to the library
                 and distribution. If you are looking for support, start in this list if you haven't found anything to
                 help you in the documentation.&lt;/p&gt;

               &lt;/li&gt;
               
&lt;li&gt;
                   o
              &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:freetype-devel@nongnu.org&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;freetype-devel@nongnu.org&lt;/a&gt;
              &lt;p&gt;Discusses bugs, as well as engine internals, design issues, specific licenses, porting, etc.&lt;/p&gt;

               &lt;/li&gt;
            
&lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;Our home page can be found at&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.freetype.org&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.freetype.org&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;/li&gt;
      
&lt;/ul&gt;

       
