          version of this License, the original English version will prevail.
        &lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;/li&gt;
      
&lt;li&gt;
         9.
        TERMINATION
        &lt;p&gt;
          You may not copy, modify, sublicense, or distribute the Document
          except as expressly provided for under this License. Any other
