          or to assert or imply endorsement of any Modified Version.
        &lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;/li&gt;
      
&lt;li&gt;
         5.
        COMBINING DOCUMENTS
        &lt;p&gt;
          You may combine the Document with other documents released under
