        &lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;/li&gt;
      
&lt;li&gt;
         2.
        VERBATIM COPYING
        &lt;p&gt;
          You may copy and distribute the Document in any medium, either
          commercially or noncommercially, provided that this License, the
