      &lt;/li&gt;
      
&lt;li&gt;
         11.
        RELICENSING
        &lt;p&gt;
          &quot;Massive Multiauthor Collaboration Site&quot; (or &quot;MMC Site&quot;) means any
          World Wide Web server that publishes copyrightable works and also
