        &lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;
          &quot;Incorporate&quot; means to publish or republish a Document,
          in whole or in part, as part of another Document.
        &lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;
          An MMC is &quot;eligible for relicensing&quot; if it is licensed under this
