         &amp;lt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gnu.org/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.gnu.org/&lt;/a&gt; licenses/why-not-lgpl.html&amp;gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</spdx:licenseTextHtml>
