    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#License"/>
    <spdx:licenseTextHtml xml:lang="en">&lt;p&gt;Independent JPEG Group License&lt;/p&gt;

      
       
         &lt;p&gt;LEGAL ISSUES&lt;/p&gt;

         &lt;p&gt;In plain English:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
            
&lt;li&gt;
                1.
          We don't promise that this software works. (But if you find any bugs, please let us know!)
        &lt;/li&gt;
            
