        the library `Frob' (a library for tweaking knobs) written&lt;br&gt;

        by James Random Hacker.
      &lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;p&gt;
        signature of Ty Coon, 1 April 1990&lt;br&gt;

        Ty Coon, President of Vice
