      &lt;p&gt;THE ACCOMPANYING PROGRAM IS PROVIDED UNDER THE TERMS OF THIS PUBLIC LICENSE (&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;). ANY USE,
         REPRODUCTION OR DISTRIBUTION OF THE PROGRAM CONSTITUTES RECIPIENT'S ACCEPTANCE OF THIS AGREEMENT.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
        
&lt;li&gt;
             1.
          DEFINITIONS
          &lt;p&gt;&quot;Contribution&quot; means:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
               
&lt;li&gt;
                   a.
            in the case of
               &amp;lt;ORGANIZATION&amp;gt; (&quot;
               &amp;lt;OWNER&amp;gt;&quot;), the Original Program, and

          &lt;/li&gt;
               
&lt;li&gt;
