            &lt;/li&gt;
                     
&lt;li&gt;
                         2.
              Information that is sufficient to obtain a complete, unmodified copy of the Work.
            &lt;/li&gt;
                  
&lt;/ul&gt;
               &lt;/li&gt;
            
&lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/li&gt;
        
&lt;li&gt;
