        &lt;p&gt;&quot;Electronic Distribution Mechanism&quot; shall mean a mechanism generally accepted in
           the software development community for the electronic transfer of data.&lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;&quot;Executable&quot; shall mean Covered Software in any form other than Source Code.&lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;&quot;Nokia&quot; shall mean Nokia Corporation and its Affiliates.&lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;&quot;Larger Work&quot; shall mean a work, which combines Covered Software or portions
