        &lt;p&gt;&quot;Modifications&quot; shall mean any addition to or deletion from the substance or
           structure of either the Original Software or any previous Modifications. When Covered
           Software is released as a series of files, a Modification is:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
            
&lt;li&gt;
                a)
